      "message": "I think you can use time_since32() since we don\u0027t expect this to be more than 2-5 ms.  That\u0027ll give you the return in us and then we also have PD_T_SENDER_RESPONSE in units of us so you can just subtract it easily. \n\nIt can be a little weird because we have that formatting of timers being `#define PD_T_SENDER_RESPONSE        (24*MSEC)`, but the MSEC is just multiplying by 1000 to calculate the define in terms of us, while keeping it easy to read.",
